# Production dependencies of the API. Edit this file, then regenerate the hashed lock
# (Python 3.12 on Linux, what the VPS runs) and the test lock from the repo root:
#   uv pip compile --generate-hashes --python-version 3.12 --python-platform x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu api/requirements.in -o api/requirements.txt
#   uv pip compile --generate-hashes --python-version 3.12 --python-platform x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu api/requirements-test.in -o api/requirements-test.txt
# The VPS installs requirements.txt with --require-hashes --only-binary :all:.
